    <item>
      <title>Spouse Visa and Residence Card Part 1: COE and Me</title>
      <link>http://localhost:39979/posts/coe-and-me/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 15:01:32 -0500</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:39979/posts/coe-and-me/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Spouse Visa and Residence Card Part 1: The COE
    &lt;div id=&#34;spouse-visa-and-residence-card-part-1-the-coe&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#spouse-visa-and-residence-card-part-1-the-coe&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, you&amp;rsquo;ve made the decision to move to Japan with your spouse - congratulations! Now, here comes the bureaucracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My wife is a Japanese national so naturally we applied for my Spouse Visa. This is one of several categories of visas that the country of Japan can issue. The full name of this visa is the &lt;em&gt;Spouse or Child of Japanese National&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:39979/posts/coe-and-me/featured.jpg" />
    </item>
    
