&lt;p&gt;This is the inagural post of the コンビニキーボード - the Konbini Keyboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am writing this blog to cover a couple of areas:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Documenting the move to Japan with my family.
    &lt;div id=&#34;documenting-the-move-to-japan-with-my-family&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
