    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a huge undertaking, to say the least. Our kids have mostly grown up in the US, we bought a home here, and got a dog. That&amp;rsquo;s pretty settled if you ask me. However, I&amp;rsquo;ll go over the reasons why we&amp;rsquo;re moving and what has helped us along the way. If you&amp;rsquo;re a technical person or a project manager, this would be akin to a Lessons Learned.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
